 ${misc:Depends}
Description: TUI project script runner
 runner reads a runner.toml describing a set of actions, shows them in an
 interactive terminal list, and runs the selected one in a child shell while
 streaming its output — including 256-color and truecolor ANSI — into a
 scrolling pane.
 .
 Features per-project action lists with groups, ${VAR} expansion and per-action
 environment injection, upward config search, and a --generate-config starter.
 .
 The binary dynamically links the system FTXUI shared libraries; the toml++
 header-only parser and the doctest test framework are used only at build time.
